  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trade Mission Processed Food</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This mission aims to support sustainable and inclusive economic growth in Lebanon through promoting exports from the Lebanese private sector to the Netherlands and EU. Lebanon has been struggling with a web of economic and political crises that rapidly worsened since late 2019 and led to extremely high unemployment and hyperinflation. Lebanon&#x2019;s limited internal production capacity and focus on the services sector result in a heavy reliance on imports for products.Increasing exports of Lebanese products would help generate much-needed foreign currency, help create or sustain jobs, and aid to ease the effects of the crisis, especially on small and medium-sized enterprises. This project is the follow-up of an export training and coaching programme for Lebanese small and medium-sized enterprises in the processed food industry.</narrative>
  </description>
